using prices.\n\nImagine there are only 14 copies of a rare coin, and then 9 more copies are found. The value of that coin falls accordingly. That's what happened when the Biden regime added $9 trillion to the existing $14 trillion money supply.\n\nImagine there are 100 houses to rent in your city, and 90 people who want to rent them. Now imagine 20 more people wanting rental housing move into town, so you've got 110 renters wanting 100 rental houses. Prices will rise accordingly as those 20 bid up rents. That's what the invasion of foreigners did to housing.   \n\nTrump cannot do anything about the money supply.  \n\nTrump has been building the infrastructure for deportations, but the brutal truth is that we just do not currently have the logistical capability to instantly deport 20 million illegals.   But Trump is building it.\n\nAll you doomer faggots and shills can eat a bag of diseased paki dicks.  ", "author": "2016TrumpMAGA", "created": 1789420824110, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Magatronic", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Why Shit Costs So Much", "last_comment_created": 1789426085140, "content": "<p>It is the Biden administration's fault.</p>\n<p>From 2021 to 2024 we imported 20 million immigrants, illegal and otherwise, and we added $9 trillion to the money supply. That's why we have inflation and out of control housing prices.</p>\n<p>Imagine there are only 14 copies of a rare coin, and then 9 more copies are found. The value of that coin falls accordingly. That's what happened when the Biden regime added $9 trillion to the existing $14 trillion money supply.</p>\n<p>Imagine there are 100 houses to rent in your city, and 90 people who want to rent them. Now imagine 20 more people wanting rental housing move into town, so you've got 110 renters wanting 100 rental houses. Prices will rise accordingly as those 20 bid up rents. That's what the invasion of foreigners did to housing.</p>\n<p>Trump cannot do anything about the money supply.</p>\n<p>Trump has been building the infrastructure for deportations, but the brutal truth is that we just do not currently have the logistical capability to instantly deport 20 million illegals.   But Trump is building it.</p>\n<p>All you doomer faggots and shills can eat a bag of diseased paki dicks.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 16, "score_up": 36, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVHV34wT", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 246, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8834301, "raw_content": "", "author": "Hallelujah_Jesus", "created": 1789383224657, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "MAGAvibesOnly", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVHV34wT.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/e23hqB3SKQNJ.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/Fdq0FmqJUwsgYu56.jpeg", "width": 768, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 756}], "blurhash": "U0LNPM00bF4q00E0IpkB0002Wq%L0LD+9axu", "full_resolution": [1031, 1047]}, "title": "Verse of the day Deuteronomy 31:8", "last_comment_created": 1789407947749, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0,